VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'pre-released now. They obviously haven\'t come out yet for me to test and make this video about. So, just keep that in mind as you watch this. But first, if you appreciate me reviewing all the newest and even unreleased smart glasses, go ahead and subscribe. We\'re doing a bunch of giveaways. Check out'

