VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Dual lens display waveguides. Pretty discreet, too. Thank the Lord, though. Dual lens display glasses are essential in my opinion to having an experience that looks really good and is really comfortable to your eyes. So, I\'m really glad that they did this. This is like'

