VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the biggest improvement they could have done in my opinion. And that\'s not even talking about the main huge feature I\'m going to show in this video. Now, the displays actually look pretty nice, clear, and a lot bigger with 1600 nits of brightness, which is brighter than the even G2s and the Roku glasses, which'

