[08:20] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'tested all of them. So, what after all this have been like my pros and cons with these glasses? First off, the display quality is like a million times better than the Holiday G1s. It\'s right up there with all the great really big dual display wavegu glasses. The font is'

[08:32] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'nice. The headset display with the weather is really nice. It tells you how much time there is until sunset and shows you this little cool sort of line that shows you how far along during the day you are. Like, it\'s just like little cool touches like that which are really'

