AUDIO: 'the quick action button for AI, and a power button, which honestly is underrated. There\'s so many smart glasses that don\'t have a power button. It\'s kind of crazy. They end up having to be in standby mode or sleep mode, and sometimes they just die, which kind of'

[09:09] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'sucks. So, the nice thing about these is they don\'t take that long to start up. Definitely not as long as the Ray Band Meetas. you can turn it off and turn it back on at your leisure, so you can keep them without having to charge them for a lot longer than glasses that you can\'t'

